      "start_verse": 8,
      "end_chapter": 3,
      "end_verse": 8,
      "title": "",
      "content": "Chaldeans (d-6) Strictly, 'men, Chaldeans;' so 'men, Jews,' ver. 12. 'Men' is from Geber, and appears in vers. 12, 13, 20-27; ch. 6.5, 11, 15, 24: see Job 3.3. accused (e-10) Or 'spoke against.' lit. 'ate the pieces of.' See Note to Job 19.22."
    },
    {
      "start_chapter": 3,
      "start_verse": 12,
      "end_chapter": 3,
      "end_verse": 12,
      "title": "",
      "content": "not (f-30) Or 'pray not to;' so vers. 14,17,18, &c."
    },
    {
      "start_chapter": 3,
      "start_verse": 19,
      "end_chapter": 3,
      "end_verse": 19,
      "title": "",
